{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch, Rest, Repeat is a cozy idle boxing game that sits at the bottom of your screen. Play while working, studying, or relaxing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095710/extras/c4131b54d2bd01a85976f2f920d30f0d.poster.avif?t=1760737714\" width=1170 height=788 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095710/extras/c4131b54d2bd01a85976f2f920d30f0d.webm?t=1760737714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095710/extras/c4131b54d2bd01a85976f2f920d30f0d.mp4?t=1760737714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train hard to become a stronger boxer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join fights and tournaments to earn rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your earnings to upgrade your equipment and improve your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095710/extras/1e4b41e0f38cc81fbcf069b6a59dc3f5.poster.avif?t=1760737714\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095710/extras/1e4b41e0f38cc81fbcf069b6a59dc3f5.webm?t=1760737714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095710/extras/1e4b41e0f38cc81fbcf069b6a59dc3f5.mp4?t=1760737714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own workout plan to boost your champion\u2019s stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095710/extras/3d19de859d7987f600becfe2655cbf1c.poster.avif?t=1760737714\" width=812 height=538 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095710/extras/3d19de859d7987f600becfe2655cbf1c.webm?t=1760737714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095710/extras/3d19de859d7987f600becfe2655cbf1c.mp4?t=1760737714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make progress through training and watch your fighter grow stronger day by day. One punch at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face rivals in random challenges and join tournaments to become a champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095710/extras/8a874f142efb93e11daaac5566b249f5.poster.avif?t=1760737714\" width=890 height=578 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095710/extras/8a874f142efb93e11daaac5566b249f5.webm?t=1760737714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095710/extras/8a874f142efb93e11daaac5566b249f5.mp4?t=1760737714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train and get stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win matches, earn rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rest well. So you can train even harder next time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch. Rest. Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4095710?t=1760737714","background_r